{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00258","headline":"从驾幸少林寺 · 则天皇后","name":"从驾幸少林寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"陪銮游禁苑，侍赏出兰闱。\n云偃攒峰盖，霞低插浪旗。\n日宫疏涧户，月殿啓岩扉。\n金轮转金地，香阁曳香衣。\n铎吟轻吹发，幡摇薄雾霏。\n昔遇焚芝火，山红连野飞。\n花台无半影，莲塔有全辉。\n实赖能仁力，攸资善世威。\n慈缘兴福绪，於此罄归依。\n风枝不可静，泣血竟何追。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"则天皇后","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00258.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00258","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}